5611103/npr-trump-cpb-lawsuit","line":86}],"metadata":{"title":"NPR receives $113 million in charitable gifts","source":"https://www.npr.org/2026/04/16/nx-s1-5787634/npr-113-million-charitable-gifts-connie-ballmer?utm_source=npr_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_content=20260723&utm_term=10876368&utm_campaign=public-editor&utm_id=60971637&orgid=26&uniquet=NsHg9nGO_ERC4gXQ_2NGbQ&utm_att1=","author":["[[David Folkenflik]]"],"published":"2026-04-16","created":"2026-07-23","description":"\"My hope is that this commitment provides the stability and the spark NPR needs to innovate boldly and strengthen its national network,\" says Connie Ballmer, who gave $80 million of the $113 million."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},